Package: nososim
Title: Nosocomial Outbreak Simulation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Cyril", "Geismar", email = "cyrilgeismar@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulate nosocomial outbreaks in populations with changing
    attendance and attributes. Model transmission using contact intensities,
    individual transmission rates, and optional interventions, and plot stays.
